# Local project context for Claude Code.
# Deliberately untracked: it records in-progress decisions, machine-specific
# setup notes and working preferences -- useful locally, but not something a
# public portfolio repo should ship. Claude Code reads it directly from disk,
# so ignoring it here does not hide it from tooling on this machine.
# Caveat: it will NOT travel with a fresh clone. Keep a backup if this repo
# ever becomes the only copy.
# Globbed rather than named exactly: the previous rules listed CLAUDE.md and
# Claude.md, so committing the file as CLAUDE.local.md matched neither and it
# shipped to a public repo. Ignore matching is case-sensitive on Linux/macOS
# even though Windows is not, so each casing needs its own line.
CLAUDE*.md
Claude*.md
claude*.md

# A stray empty clone of this repo was created inside the project root.
# Left ignored so `git add -A` does not abort on it; safe to delete outright.
System-Design-Simulator/
